# Testing

- Domain bugs get fixtures under `fixtures/menu-patterns/` plus tests.
- Use Vitest for unit/domain; fast-check for numbering/pricing/purity/determinism invariants.
- Keep tests deterministic and reproducible.
- `npm run check` is the normal non-production quality gate.
- Do not run Playwright/integration suites for trivial domain edits.
